# This checkout is a named build context for the image ql-frontend's Dockerfile
# builds (--build-context ql-backend=...). That build reads CMakeLists.txt, src,
# proto and third_party/uWebSockets; everything below is large, local, or both,
# and would otherwise be sent to the builder on every build.
**/.git
.idea
.venv
build
build-*
cmake-build-*
third_party/QuantLib
doc/_build
**/__pycache__
CLAUDE.md
